 del PC)"," — loopback de lo que reproduce el PC",[31,906,907,910],{},[18,908,909],{},"Volumen de entrada"," — ganancia de captura del 0 % al 200 %",[14,912,913],{},"El botón Grabar usa el dispositivo que eliges aquí.",[23,915,917],{"id":916},"editar-la-toma","Editar la toma",[66,919,920,923,926,934,937,940],{},[31,921,922],{},"Grabar y detener",[31,924,925],{},"Observar el medidor de nivel de entrada",[31,927,928,310,931],{},[18,929,930],{},"Normalizar",[18,932,933],{},"Cancelación de ruido",[31,935,936],{},"Recortar todo el clip, recortar a una selección o borrar una selección",[31,938,939],{},"Deshacer \u002F rehacer",[31,941,942],{},"Acercar y alejar",[23,944,946],{"id":945},"preparar-e-importar","Preparar e importar",[28,948,949,952,955],{},[31,950,951],{},"Añade la selección o la pista completa a la lista de staging.",[31,953,954],{},"La lista empieza vacía: graba, edita y luego añade un clip.",[31,956,957,310,959,566],{},[18,958,562],{},[18,960,565],{},[23,962,964],{"id":963},"separación-de-stems-opcional","Separación de stems (opcional)",[14,966,967,968,310,971,974,975,978],{},"El Record Editor puede conservar ",[18,969,970],{},"voces",[18,972,973],{},"música"," con BS-RoFormer. El modelo pesa unos 158 MB y ",[18,976,977],{},"no"," viene incluido con la app.",[14,980,981,982,985],{},"Descárgalo desde ",[18,983,984],{},"Ajustes → Separación de stems",", o acepta el aviso del primer arranque. El instalador de Windows también puede ofrecer descargar el modelo al primer inicio.",[14,987,988,989,41,992,995],{},"Las builds desde código con stems necesitan un flag extra (",[38,990,991],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[38,993,994],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":139,"searchDepth":140,"depth":140,"links":997},[998,999,1000,1001],{"id":883,"depth":140,"text":884},{"id":916,"depth":140,"text":917},{"id":945,"depth":140,"text":946},{"id":963,"depth":140,"text":964},"Captura micrófono o audio del PC, edita el clip y suéltalo en tu tablero.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":869,"description":1002},"recording-editor","6kXc1zcNP9ffTeowsG3fPS8NGId-wyGEWWxVXslWkZE",{"id":1010,"title":1011,"body":1012,"description":1224,"extension":147,"meta":1225,"navigation":149,"order":1226,"path":1227,"seo":1228,"stem":1229,"__hash__":1230},"content_es\u002Fremote-control.md","Control remoto",{"type":7,"value":1013,"toc":1217},[1014,1017,1020,1024,1053,1056,1059,1094,1098,1118,1121,1125,1157,1161,1167],[10,1015,1011],{"id":1016},"control-remoto",[14,1018,1019],{},"SoundNinja puede escuchar en tu red local para que Bitfocus Companion (o cualquier cliente HTTP\u002FWebSocket) reproduzca y detenga sonidos.",[23,1021,1023],{"id":1022},"activar-el-servidor-remoto","Activar el servidor remoto",[28,1025,1026,1031,1037,1043],{},[31,1027,494,1028,21],{},[18,1029,1030],{},"Ajustes → Remoto",[31,1032,1033,1034,21],{},"Activa el servidor remoto. El puerto por defecto es ",[18,1035,1036],{},"7331",[31,1038,1039,1040,21],{},"Opcional: define un token. Los clientes deben enviarlo como Bearer token o ",[38,1041,1042],{},"?token=",[31,1044,1045,1046,1049,1050,21],{},"Copia la URL ",[38,1047,1048],{},"http:\u002F\u002FIP:PORT",", o copia la IP del sistema desde ",[18,1051,1052],{},"Ajustes → Acerca de",[14,1054,1055],{},"Windows puede mostrar un aviso del firewall la primera vez que arranca el servidor. Permite el acceso a la red privada.",[23,1057,219],{"id":1058},"bitfocus-companion",[28,1060,1061,1068,1077,1087],{},[31,1062,1063,1064,21],{},"Instala ",[216,1065,219],{"href":1066,"rel":1067},"https:\u002F\u002Fbitfocus.io\u002Fcompanion",[237],[31,1069,1070,1071,1076],{},"Descarga ",[216,1072,1075],{"href":1073,"rel":1074},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Freleases\u002Flatest\u002Fdownload\u002Fcompanion-module-soundninja.tgz",[237],"companion-module-soundninja.tgz",". Aún no hay paquete en Companion Store.",[31,1078,1079,1080,1083,1084,21],{},"En Companion: ",[18,1081,1082],{},"Modules → Load module package"," y elige el ",[38,1085,1086],{},".tgz",[31,1088,1089,1090,1093],{},"Añade una conexión ",[18,1091,1092],{},"Sound Ninja",". Pega la IP del PC, el puerto y el token si definiste uno.",[23,1095,1097],{"id":1096},"acciones","Acciones",[66,1099,1100,1106,1112],{},[31,1101,1102,1105],{},[18,1103,1104],{},"Trigger Sound"," — elige en el menú desplegable en vivo, o escribe un ID de sonido de 8 caracteres (las variables de Companion funcionan)",[31,1107,1108,1111],{},[18,1109,1110],{},"Stop Sound"," — detiene un sonido en reproducción por ID",[31,1113,1114,1117],{},[18,1115,1116],{},"Stop All"," — detiene todos los sonidos en reproducción",[14,1119,1120],{},"Copia un ID de sonido en SoundNinja desde el menú contextual del botón o el chip de ID de la selección múltiple.",[23,1122,1124],{"id":1123},"feedbacks-y-variables","Feedbacks y variables",[66,1126,1127,1133,1145,1151],{},[31,1128,1129,1132],{},[18,1130,1131],{},"Sound Playing"," — verdadero mientras ese ID de sonido está activo (úsalo para el color del botón)",[31,1134,1135,1138,1139,41,1142],{},[38,1136,1137],{},"$(soundninja:connected)"," — ",[38,1140,1141],{},"true",[38,1143,1144],{},"false",[31,1146,1147,1150],{},[38,1148,1149],{},"$(soundninja:playing_count)"," — cuántos sonidos suenan",[31,1152,1153,1156],{},[38,1154,1155],{},"$(soundninja:last_triggered)"," — último ID de sonido disparado",[23,1158,1160],{"id":1159},"api-http-avanzado","API HTTP (avanzado)",[14,1162,1163,1164],{},"Ruta base: ",[38,1165,1166],{},"\u002Fapi\u002Fv1",[66,1168,1169,1175,1181,1187,1197,1203,1211],{},[31,1170,1171,1174],{},[38,1172,1173],{},"GET \u002Finfo"," — nombre de la app, versión, protocolo, si se requiere un token",[31,1176,1177,1180],{},[38,1178,1179],{},"GET \u002Fsounds"," — lista de sonidos (id, name, tabs, active)",[31,1182,1183,1186],{},[38,1184,1185],{},"GET \u002Fstate"," — sonidos más IDs que suenan ahora",[31,1188,1189,1192,1193,1196],{},[38,1190,1191],{},"POST \u002Ftrigger"," con ",[38,1194,1195],{},"{ \"id\" }"," — reproducir un sonido",[31,1198,1199,1202],{},[38,1200,1201],{},"GET \u002Ftrigger\u002F:id"," — reproducir (fácil de probar en el navegador)",[31,1204,1205,1192,1208,1210],{},[38,1206,1207],{},"POST \u002Fstop",[38,1209,1195],{}," opcional — detener un sonido o todos",[31,1212,1213,1216],{},[38,1214,1215],{},"GET \u002Fws"," — estado en vivo; enviar comandos trigger\u002Fstop de entrada",{"title":139,"searchDepth":140,"depth":140,"links":1218},[1219,1220,1221,1222,1223],{"id":1022,"depth":140,"text":1023},{"id":1058,"depth":140,"text":219},{"id":1096,"depth":140,"text":1097},{"id":1123,"depth":140,"text":1124},{"id":1159,"depth":140,"text":1160},"Dispara SoundNinja desde Bitfocus Companion en la red local.",{},7,"\u002Fremote-control",{"title":1011,"description":1224},"remote-control","FXZNdlLVwqBTHCjLmpjNr2ZHY0S5NmW5TzHr5uUtI7U",{"id":1232,"title":1233,"body":1234,"description":1322,"extension":147,"meta":1323,"navigation":149,"order":1324,"path":1325,"seo":1326,"stem":1327,"__hash__":1328},"content_es\u002Fsupport.md","Soporte",{"type":7,"value":1235,"toc":1315},[1236,1239,1242,1246,1249,1256,1264,1268,1275,1277,1290,1294,1305,1309],[10,1237,1233],{"id":1238},"soporte",[14,1240,1241],{},"SoundNinja es un proyecto comunitario en beta temprana. La forma más rápida de pedir ayuda es GitHub.",[23,1243,1245],{"id":1244},"reportar-un-error-o-hacer-una-pregunta","Reportar un error o hacer una pregunta",[14,1247,1248],{},"Abre un issue en GitHub:",[14,1250,1251],{},[216,1252,1255],{"href":1253,"rel":1254},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fissues",[237],"github.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fissues",[14,1257,1258,1259,310,1261,1263],{},"Incluye tu SO, la versión de SoundNinja (",[18,1260,393],{},[18,1262,1052],{},") y los pasos para reproducirlo.",[23,1265,1267],{"id":1266},"correo","Correo",[14,1269,1270,1271],{},"Contacto del mantenedor: ",[216,1272,1274],{"href":1273},"mailto:contact@marcus-universe.de","contact@marcus-universe.de",[23,1276,387],{"id":386},[14,1278,1279,1280,1282,1283,1285,1286,21],{},"En la app, usa ",[18,1281,393],{},". Las builds nuevas también aparecen en la ",[216,1284,291],{"href":290}," y en ",[216,1287,297],{"href":1288,"rel":1289},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Freleases",[237],[23,1291,1293],{"id":1292},"contribuir","Contribuir",[14,1295,1296,1297,1301,1302,21],{},"Los pull requests son bienvenidos. El repo de la app es ",[216,1298,1300],{"href":404,"rel":1299},[237],"github.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja",". El proyecto está bajo licencia ",[216,1303,238],{"href":235,"rel":1304},[237],[23,1306,1308],{"id":1307},"aviso-legal","Aviso legal",[14,1310,1311,1312,21],{},"Aviso legal y datos de contacto: ",[216,1313,1308],{"href":1314},"\u002Fimpressum",{"title":139,"searchDepth":140,"depth":140,"links":1316},[1317,1318,1319,1320,1321],{"id":1244,"depth":140,"text":1245},{"id":1266,"depth":140,"text":1267},{"id":386,"depth":140,"text":387},{"id":1292,"depth":140,"text":1293},{"id":1307,"depth":140,"text":1308},"Dónde pedir ayuda y reportar errores.",{},8,"\u002Fsupport",{"title":1233,"description":1322},"support","a00is-hTbQUOnHv2YiZDFMQVyUfDSKLK4GccVuiJQ9c",1788386868156]